4. retrieve({"query": "return window policy expired late return exceptions"}) -> {"results": [{"chunk_id": "electronics_return_addendum_c0", "source": "electronics_return_addendum", "text": "# Electronics Return Policy Addendum *Last updated: 2024-11-15* ## Electronics Returns - Detailed Policy This addendum to the main return policy provides additional detail for electronics. ### Return Window Electronics may be returned within **30 days** of delivery date, consistent with our standard policy. ### Opened Items Opened electronics are accepted within the 30-day window but are subject to a **15% restocking fee** unless: - The item is defective - The item was damaged in shipping - The item was not as described ### Excluded Items The following electronics categories are non-returnable once opened: - Software, digital downloads, and digital subscriptions - Items with broken manufacturer seals on hygiene-sensitive components (earbuds, in-ear thermometers) - Custom-configured items (PCs built to order, engraved products) ### Manufacturer Warranties Many electronics carry separate manufacturer warranties that may extend beyond our return window. Review the product manual for warranty information.", "score": 1.0, "queries": ["return window policy expired late return exceptions", "what happens if I return an item after the return window has closed", "are there any exceptions to the standard return deadline", "can I still return a product outside the return period"]}, {"chunk_id": "return_policy_c0", "source": "return_policy", "text": "# MarketSphere Return Policy *Last updated: 2024-11-15* ## Standard Returns MarketSphere accepts returns on most items within **30 days** of delivery, provided the item is unused, in original packaging, and accompanied by proof of purchase. ## Category-Specific Windows Different product categories have different return windows due to manufacturer agreements and product nature: - **Electronics**: 30 days from delivery, in original sealed packaging where applicable. Opened electronics may be subject to a 15% restocking fee. - **Apparel and footwear**: 60 days from delivery, with tags attached and unworn. - **Home goods and furniture**: 30 days from delivery. Large items may require return shipping coordination. - **Beauty and personal care**: 14 days from delivery, unopened only. - **Perishables and consumables**: Not eligible for return except in case of defect. - **Final sale items**: Not eligible for return. Items marked \"Final Sale\" at purchase cannot be returned or exchanged. ## How to Initiate a Return 1. Log into your MarketSphere account and navigate to Orders. 2. Select the item and click \"Start a Return.\" 3. Choose a reason and select your preferred resolution (refund or exchange). 4. Print the prepaid return label (where applicable) and ship within 7 days. ## Refund Timing Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days of receipt at our returns center. The funds typically post to the original payment method within an additional 3-5 business days depending on the issuer. ## Exceptions Items damaged in transit, defective on arrival, or shipped incorrectly are eligible for return regardless of category-specific windows and do not incur restocking fees. See the \"Damaged or Defective Items\" policy for details.", "score": 1.0, "queries": ["return window policy expired late return exceptions", "what happens if I return an item after the return window has closed", "are there any exceptions to the standard return deadline", "can I still return a product outside the return period"]}, {"chunk_id": "damaged_or_defective_policy_c0", "source": "damaged_or_defective_policy", "text": "# Damaged or Defective Items Policy *Last updated: 2024-09-15* ## Reporting Damage or Defects If your order arrives damaged, or an item is defective, contact support within 7 days of delivery for the fastest resolution. ## What We Need - Order number - Photos showing the damage or defect - Description of the issue ## Resolution Options For damaged or defective items, we offer: 1. **Full replacement** at no cost, with expedited shipping. 2. **Full refund** including original shipping. 3. **Partial refund** if you wish to keep the item. You do not pay return shipping for damaged or defective items. We provide a prepaid label or arrange pickup for larger items. ## Manufacturing Defects After 30 Days Defects that appear after the 30-day return window are handled through the warranty process. See the Warranty Policy.", "score": 1.0, "queries": ["return window policy expired late return exceptions", "what happens if I return an item after the return window has closed"]}, {"chunk_id": "faq_partial_return_c0", "source": "faq_partial_return", "text": "# Can I return only some items from a multi-item order? *Last updated: 2024-09-01* ## Question Can I return only some items from a multi-item order? ## Answer Yes. You can return individual items from a multi-item order. Each returned item is refunded individually. The remaining items keep their original pricing and any volume discounts applied at the time of purchase.", "score": 1.0, "queries": ["what happens if I return an item after the return window has closed", "can I still return a product outside the return period"]}, {"chunk_id": "faq_return_window_c0", "source": "faq_return_window", "text": "# What's the return window? *Last updated: 2024-09-01* ## Question What's the return window? ## Answer Standard return window is 30 days from delivery for most items, 60 days for apparel and footwear. Some categories have different windows (electronics 30 days, beauty 14 days). Final sale items are not returnable. See the Return Policy for full details.", "score": 0.9370604176775473, "queries": ["return window policy expired late return exceptions", "what happens if I return an item after the return window has closed", "are there any exceptions to the standard return deadline"]}]}

