wing delivery", "what is the return window duration policy"]}, {"chunk_id": "return_policy_c0", "source": "return_policy", "text": "# MarketSphere Return Policy *Last updated: 2024-11-15* ## Standard Returns MarketSphere accepts returns on most items within **30 days** of delivery, provided the item is unused, in original packaging, and accompanied by proof of purchase. ## Category-Specific Windows Different product categories have different return windows due to manufacturer agreements and product nature: - **Electronics**: 30 days from delivery, in original sealed packaging where applicable. Opened electronics may be subject to a 15% restocking fee. - **Apparel and footwear**: 60 days from delivery, with tags attached and unworn. - **Home goods and furniture**: 30 days from delivery. Large items may require return shipping coordination. - **Beauty and personal care**: 14 days from delivery, unopened only. - **Perishables and consumables**: Not eligible for return except in case of defect. - **Final sale items**: Not eligible for return. Items marked \"Final Sale\" at purchase cannot be returned or exchanged. ## How to Initiate a Return 1. Log into your MarketSphere account and navigate to Orders. 2. Select the item and click \"Start a Return.\" 3. Choose a reason and select your preferred resolution (refund or exchange). 4. Print the prepaid return label (where applicable) and ship within 7 days. ## Refund Timing Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days of receipt at our returns center. The funds typically post to the original payment method within an additional 3-5 business days depending on the issuer. ## Exceptions Items damaged in transit, defective on arrival, or shipped incorrectly are eligible for return regardless of category-specific windows and do not incur restocking fees. See the \"Damaged or Defective Items\" policy for details.", "score": 0.6242841370384044, "queries": ["return window policy how many days after delivery", "how many days do i have to return an item after it arrives", "return period timeframe following delivery", "what is the return window duration policy"]}, {"chunk_id": "damaged_or_defective_policy_c0", "source": "damaged_or_defective_policy", "text": "# Damaged or Defective Items Policy *Last updated: 2024-09-15* ## Reporting Damage or Defects If your order arrives damaged, or an item is defective, contact support within 7 days of delivery for the fastest resolution. ## What We Need - Order number - Photos showing the damage or defect - Description of the issue ## Resolution Options For damaged or defective items, we offer: 1. **Full replacement** at no cost, with expedited shipping. 2. **Full refund** including original shipping. 3. **Partial refund** if you wish to keep the item. You do not pay return shipping for damaged or defective items. We provide a prepaid label or arrange pickup for larger items. ## Manufacturing Defects After 30 Days Defects that appear after the 30-day return window are handled through the warranty process. See the Warranty Policy.", "score": 0.414069502846076, "queries": ["return window policy how many days after delivery", "how many days do i have to return an item after it arrives", "return period timeframe following delivery", "what is the return window duration policy"]}, {"chunk_id": "faq_refund_timing_c0", "source": "faq_refund_timing", "text": "# When will I get my refund? *Last updated: 2024-09-01* ## Question When will I get my refund? ## Answer Once your return arrives at our returns center, we process the refund within 5-7 business days. After we issue the refund, your bank or card issuer typically posts the funds in 3-5 additional business days. Total time from drop-off to funds available is usually 10-12 business days.", "score": 0.05671613534889696, "queries": ["how many days do i have to return an item after it arrives"]}]}

