2. retrieve({"query": "headphones won't turn on troubleshooting"}) -> {"results": [{"chunk_id": "ms-head-1007_c1", "source": "ms-head-1007", "text": "earbud models, clean the mesh grilles gently with a soft brush. Do not insert objects into the speaker openings. Troubleshooting **Headphones won't turn on**: Charge for at least 30 minutes. If still not responsive, hold the power button for 15 seconds to perform a hard reset. **Cannot pair**: Forget the device from your phone's Bluetooth list and try again. Reset the headphones to factory settings by holding power + volume down for 10 seconds. **One side has no sound**: Check Bluetooth balance settings on source device. Try playing on a different source to isolate. Warranty This product carries a one-year manufacturer warranty against defects in materials and workmanship under normal use. The warranty does not cover damage from drops, liquid, or unauthorized modifications. To file a warranty claim, visit marketsphere.example/warranty or contact support. Specifications", "score": 1.0, "queries": ["headphones won't turn on troubleshooting", "why are my headphones not powering on", "how to fix headphones that won't power up", "troubleshoot headphones that won't turn on"]}, {"chunk_id": "ms-head-1005_c1", "source": "ms-head-1005", "text": "gently with a soft brush. Do not insert objects into the speaker openings. Troubleshooting **Headphones won't turn on**: Charge for at least 30 minutes. If still not responsive, hold the power button for 15 seconds to perform a hard reset. **Cannot pair**: Forget the device from your phone's Bluetooth list and try again. Reset the headphones to factory settings by holding power + volume down for 10 seconds. **One side has no sound**: Check Bluetooth balance settings on source device. Try playing on a different source to isolate. Warranty This product carries a one-year manufacturer warranty against defects in materials and workmanship under normal use. The warranty does not cover damage